Closing the Meeting
The question isn't whether the bank will adopt agentic tools like Claude Code—engineers will always find a way to use them to move faster. The question is whether we do it via an unenforceable honor system on local laptops, or through a hardened control plane like Coder where security boundaries are cryptographically and structurally enforced. We are ready to demonstrate this control in a isolated, audited pilot.
